\textsf P(A) = \hspace{4.7cm} \hspace{1.3cm}\textsf P(A \mid \text{all certain})\cdot\textsf P(\text{all certain}) + \hspace{1.5 cm } \textsf P(A\mid \text{not all certain})\cdot\textsf P(\text{not all certain}) \\
= 1\cdot1 + \frac 35\cdot \frac 25 =\frac{7}{10} 
 \end{align}
 $$
